; Regression test for GitHub issue #3314: a posting whose lot has a
; fixated price, {=$150.00}, takes its cost from that price within its
; own group.  Here both postings are balanced virtual ones, in
; [brackets]; pricing the lot only when the real postings needed it left
; this purchase unbalanced against the bracketed cash.

2020-02-01 Budget for shares
    [Budget:Shares]                     10 AAPL {=$150.00}
    [Budget:Checking]               $-1500.00

test bal --flat
           $-1500.00  Budget:Checking
             10 AAPL  Budget:Shares
--------------------
           $-1500.00
             10 AAPL
end test

test bal --flat --basis
           $-1500.00  Budget:Checking
            $1500.00  Budget:Shares
--------------------
                   0
end test
